&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt; Characteristics

&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;INSULATOR:PBT

&lt;br&gt;FLAMMABILITY RATING: UL94-V0

